{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529010?t=1741257217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741257217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/e3db48c15fda588510c293075318b4f3a1be0e85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741257217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/e3db48c15fda588510c293075318b4f3a1be0e85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741257217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cocolaugh"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/header.jpg?t=1741257217","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Blood Curse Legions","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIN11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Cocolaugh"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age